{"id":"00049","root":"uni00049_1","name":{"ja":"セドナ・アルストナ","en":"Cedna Arstonna"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"セドナ・アルストナ","en":"Cedna Arstonna"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":45,"profile":{"ja":"米連のごくわずかしか知らないといわれる暗殺特殊部隊の一員。極秘に開発された、ゼロ・ステルスと呼ばれる全身スーツを身に纏い、要人の暗殺や、魔界技術奪取のための汚れ仕事を全般に行っている。特殊部隊の性質故、部隊名は無いが、ゼロ部隊と影では呼ばれている。その部隊でも特に非情に任務をこなすセドナ。たとえそれが家族であろうと元同僚であろうと容赦なく殺害する事で、感情が死んでいると周りからは言われている。セドナはゼロ・ステルスの光学迷彩を、自らはあまり使わず、代わりに腕と足に装着したブレードに使用しており、武装を隠して行動する事が多い。セドナは過去に最強の兵士を作るという構想の元、恐怖を抱かせない精神調教を施されている。その実験はほとんどが失敗しているが、唯一の成功例がセドナで、その実験が中止された後に保護されたが、完全に精神が戻ることはなく、今の組織に移された。そのため、喜怒哀楽はほぼ無く、命令に純粋な兵士と化している。そんな頃、ふうまの連合に参加する事になる。元から持つ純粋な命令遵守をふうまの指揮のもと存分に発揮する事になる。","en":"Cedna Arstonna is a member of a secret assassination unit known to very few within the United States Alliance. She dons the Zero-Stealth full-body suit, a top-secret development, and handles all dirty work—from high-profile assassinations to the theft of demon-realm technology. The unit has no official name, but it is referred to as the Zero Unit or \"the Shadows.\" Among them, Cedna is especially ruthless, killing without hesitation even if the target is family or a former comrade, leading others to say her emotions are dead. She rarely uses the suit's optical camouflage herself; instead, she applies it to the blades attached to her arms and legs, often concealing her weapons during missions. Cedna was once subjected to a mental conditioning program aimed at creating the ultimate soldier, one that would not feel fear. Most of the experiments failed, but she was the sole success; after the program was halted, she was rescued but never fully recovered mentally, and was transferred to her current organization. Consequently, she shows almost no joy, anger, sorrow, or pleasure, becoming a pure instrument of orders. During this time she joined the Fuuma coalition, where she now fully demonstrates her innate obedience under Fuuma's command."},"illustrator":"ほむらゆに","voiceActor":"早瀬ゃょぃ","forms":[{"id":"uni00049_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[764,1528],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[116,232],"def":[88,176],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":34,"skills":["5","117"]},{"id":"uni00049_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1128,2256],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[166,332],"def":[126,252],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":34,"skills":["5","117","118"]},{"id":"uni00049_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1492,2985],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[248,495],"def":[164,329],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":34,"skills":["5","117","118"]}],"skills":{"5":{"slot":"attack","id":5,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"科学属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Science damage"}]},"117":{"slot":"skill1","id":117,"name":{"ja":"ブラック・フィアー"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で暗闇状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で暗闇状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で暗闇状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で暗闇状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で暗闇状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 107% Science damage"},{"text":"All enemies: 30% chance to inflict Darkness for 3 turns","icon":"darkness"}]},"118":{"slot":"skill2","id":118,"name":{"ja":"ゼロ・ステルス"},"hits":3,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で３回攻撃する"}},{"level":2,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で３回攻撃する"}},{"level":3,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で３回攻撃する"}},{"level":4,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で３回攻撃する"}},{"level":5,"sp":230,"detail":{"ja":"ランダムな敵に小威力で３回攻撃する"}}],"effects":[{"